<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fĕrīnus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to wild animals</i>
			(mostly <b>poet.</b>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Cic., for Inv. 1, 2, 2, is to be read
					victu fero): vultus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 523</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tr. 5, 12, 55</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caedes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					7, 675</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caro,</span>”
				<i>venison</i>, <i>game</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. J. 18, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">89, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 28,
				32, § 161</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lac,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 571</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestis,</span>”
				<i>of the skins of wild beasts</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 1418</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">voluptates,</span>”
				<i>brutal sensuality</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					19, 2 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			— <b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vita,</span>”
				<i>low</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 26, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">15, 3</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fĕrīna</span></b> , ae,
			f., <i>the flesh of wild animals</i>, <i>game</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 1, 215</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 3,
				569</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pomum a ceteris distans sapore quodam ferinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					13, 4, 9, § 43</span></i>
			.</div>
